    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p>No need to sail the seas alone! Join the discord, gather up a crew, and set sail!<br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Trash Sailors is a hand-drawn co-op sailing adventure for one to four players. Create the trashiest team in history in online or local co-op!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132030/extras/ae0e050e13856c6de1b733e509844f1d.poster.avif?t=1739398197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132030/extras/ae0e050e13856c6de1b733e509844f1d.webm?t=1739398197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132030/extras/ae0e050e13856c6de1b733e509844f1d.mp4?t=1739398197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The world was flooded by a giant Trash Tsunami! Luckily for you, a lot of trash is floating around. Trash is your main resource and the most valuable thing in this world. You can recycle it into fuel, raft spare parts, and even weapons. Brace yourself for swamp crocodiles, toxic sharks, arctic pirates, and much, much more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online and local 4-player coop.<br></li><li>Hand-drawn Trash Piracy.<br></li><li>Dozens of seas for treasure hunting and monster feeding!<br></li><li>Uncivilized battles for the last piece of trash.<br></li><li>Literally an ocean of trash to sail with your friends!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Trash Sailors is a hand-drawn co-op sailing adventure for one to four players. Create the trashiest team in history in online or local co-op!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132030/extras/ae0e050e13856c6de1b733e509844f1d.poster.avif?t=1739398197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132030/extras/ae0e050e13856c6de1b733e509844f1d.webm?t=1739398197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132030/extras/ae0e050e13856c6de1b733e509844f1d.mp4?t=1739398197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The world was flooded by a giant Trash Tsunami! Luckily for you, a lot of trash is floating around. Trash is your main resource and the most valuable thing in this world. You can recycle it into fuel, raft spare parts, and even weapons. Brace yourself for swamp crocodiles, toxic sharks, arctic pirates, and much, much more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online and local 4-player coop.<br></li><li>Hand-drawn Trash Piracy.<br></li><li>Dozens of seas for treasure hunting and monster feeding!<br></li><li>Uncivilized battles for the last piece of trash.<br></li><li>Literally an ocean of trash to sail with your friends!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Trash Sailors is a hand-drawn co-op sailing adventure for one to four players. Create the trashiest team in history, in online or local co-op and find your way in the aftermath of a great trash tsunami.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe proof is in the playing but in theory, yeah, I\u2019m up for these antics with my pals.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cMaybe you're a grizzled sea dog with a gold tooth, maybe you're a girl with a strong killer instinct, or maybe you're fat. Whatever\u2014your job is to stay alive and keep your raft afloat and moving.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br>",
